// True Parents quotes. Each text is copied word for word (only line breaks and spaces normalised) from the English text published at the linked
// tparents.org page, as saved in the UM Ireland "True Parents Library" Drive documents (retrieved 2026-10-30). Place is as printed on the source page; "not stated" where it is not given.
var QUOTES=[{"text":"In the family, parents are to live for children, children for parents, husband for wife and wife for husband.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Path for America and Humanity in the Last Days","date":"January 22, 2000","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon00/UM000122.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"God first existed because of love and he needed an object because of love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Morning Address","date":"January 1, 2003","place":"Chung Pyung Heaven and Earth Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon03/SM030101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Unlimited love means that no matter how much God gave his child he never feels that it is enough.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Morning Address","date":"January 1, 2003","place":"Chung Pyung Heaven and Earth Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon03/SM030101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When you invest with true love the more you invest the more it multiplies.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Morning Address","date":"January 1, 2003","place":"Chung Pyung Heaven and Earth Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon03/SM030101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"With that grateful heart, in the realm of mind with one focus, each and every one of us will overcome all suffering and advance toward supreme victory.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 2010 Midnight Prayer","date":"January 1, 2010","place":"Cheon Jeong Gung","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon10/SunMyungMoon-100101-mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"In the world of love, centering on true love, the end will be greater.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Total Investment","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon12/SunMyungMoon-120000.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Unless you live your life by totally giving yourself, you will not able to meet the path of true love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Total Investment","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon12/SunMyungMoon-120000.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"In order for you to live purposefully toward your ideal destination, you need this life philosophy of living for the sake of others.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Total Investment","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon12/SunMyungMoon-120000.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The more such people there are, the more God will be with them and the more God will be delighted.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus' View of Life for the Sake of the Restoration","date":"January 6, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570106.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"For the fulfillment of such a mission, we should love God with all our hearts, all our souls and all our minds.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus Willing to Fulfill God's Love","date":"February 24, 1957","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570224a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When you have faced the love of God, then you will taste the love of God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God is seeking a man whose heart is so overflowing with love that everyone will find in him a real eternal resting ground.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God is looking for that man who can touch His heart, who can give God joy.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Father, in this moment, we would like to confess our lonesome hearts before You and exchange them for Your heart.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Prayer: Allow Us To Discover The Condition In Which Our Hearts Now Lie","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SunMyungMoon-650000.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We cannot live unless we can exchange our inexpressibly sad and grieving hearts for Your heart of joy and life.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Prayer: Allow Us To Discover The Condition In Which Our Hearts Now Lie","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SunMyungMoon-650000.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"At the beginning of the New Year, I sincerely hope and advise you to do your best in following the way to loyalty and filial piety to God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Let's Establish the Foundation for Unification (Part I)","date":"January 1, 1971","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon71/SunMyungMoon-710101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"By having faith in God, channeling the power and energy from God, you can draw limitless power from heaven.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Instructions To IOWC Commanders And Team Members","date":"January 31, 1974","place":"Washington, DC","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon74/SunMyungMoon-740131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"God has established a worldwide base of heart, by transcending races and nationalities and caring for religions.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Liberation Of Heaven And Earth","date":"March 3, 1976","place":"Choongang Training Center (Sootaek-li) Kyungki-do, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SM760303.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We are longing for what God is longing for, and we have the God-designed family.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"In One Battle We Want to Liquidate the Failures of the Past","date":"January 12, 1976","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760112.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The love of the ideal of creation is the love centered on God, binding together husband and wife.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Message at the Unification Ceremony","date":"January 31, 1976","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"An individual exists for his family, a family for its clan, a clan for its tribe, a tribe for its nation, a nation for the world, the world for the heaven and earth, and heaven and earth for God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Message at the Unification Ceremony","date":"January 31, 1976","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Speaking about the ideal of creation, we must earnestly fulfill the ideal that God implanted in us with His sincere heart.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Message at the Unification Ceremony","date":"January 31, 1976","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The power of prayer works wonders, but prayer must be serious and done with one united heart, not a divided heart.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Prayer Must Be Serious","date":"April 15, 1979 (as printed; the page address suggests 1976)","place":"Belvedere, NY","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760415.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Deep prayer is not a short prayer of one hour but ten hours, and all day long with seriousness in your heart.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Prayer Must Be Serious","date":"April 15, 1979 (as printed; the page address suggests 1976)","place":"Belvedere, NY","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760415.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"I love to pray through the quiet of midnight, because it is the best time for meditating.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Prayer Must Be Serious","date":"April 15, 1979 (as printed; the page address suggests 1976)","place":"Belvedere, NY","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760415.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The conclusion is that the true man and the true woman who center on love are the standard of hope humanity wishes for.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Central Figure And The Transitional Period","date":"March 7, 1976","place":"Chung-pa Dong Headquarters Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/sm760307.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"True love makes a person welcome the dirty little baby, messing up everything in his house, because true love goes beyond everything.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"True love between husband and wife is the love of give and take between a man and woman of united mind and body.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The true saint is not one who only cares for his family, but who first cares for others, even those who care the least for him, before his own family.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"With true love, you must go down to the lowest places and you will discover the shortcut to reaching God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"As God treats a person directly, you must develop the heart to treat the person with the same feeling that God does.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Assistance of the Spirit World and Ourselves (I)","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820001.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"A place where you live will become the dwelling place where you and God live together.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Assistance of the Spirit World and Ourselves (I)","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820001.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Even if you face difficulty, you conduct your life possessing a mind desiring to help others for the good of the whole.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Assistance of the Spirit World and Ourselves (I)","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820001.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"You may not be the greatest artist, sculptor or singer, but if you sing with true love, yours is the best music.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820101-Mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We thank You for giving us Your protection and direction and surrounding us with Your love throughout the providential course.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Prayer","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820101-pray.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We came into being through love, and the purpose of our existence is to form the foundation of love, to expand our love by connecting it with others, and to perfect love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When one is born in love, grows up centered on love, and bears the fruit of love, he or she is said to be perfect.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Even God Himself cannot change the value of love, and He cannot go against love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"If we can get love just as easily as we get fast food, then such love is probably not true love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When a true man and woman share love and give birth to children, they cannot go through such a holy process without crying tears of joy.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Centering on true love, to live for the sake of others and to continue on to live for the sake of others on higher and higher levels, this will bring the only contents that remain.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Sunday Service","date":"February 17, 1991","place":"Belvedere International Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/910217.htm","verified":true,"note":"date corrected from 1997 to 1991 per the page address and text"},
{"text":"If you are living for the sake of true love, the worst woman, the worst man will welcome you.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Sunday Service","date":"February 17, 1991","place":"Belvedere International Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/910217.htm","verified":true,"note":"date corrected from 1997 to 1991 per the page address and text"},
{"text":"Even a grown man or woman want to be carried on the back of true love, as a small baby is carried on the back of his mother.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1991 - Midnight","date":"January 1, 1991","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/SM910101.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"True love was the key that left my heart unharmed from the wounds of criticism, persecution, opposition and scorn.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"As the God of love, his sole desire has been to find his children, embrace them once again to his bosom and finally realize the ideal of peace that he had envisaged at the beginning of creation.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"In contrast, the Pacific civilization should establish an altruistic culture based on true love, on living for the sake of others.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"The only way for us to become one is to become children of the Creator God, who is the owner of the universe.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"All Religions Have Reached The End, Yet We Need To Realize The World Of Peace","date":"January 9, 2022","place":"Cheongshim World Peace Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-22/HakJaHan-220109.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"We should feel true ownership just as God does and become one in all respects, cooperating with one another to fulfill this work.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Become true owners of Cheon Il Guk who practice true love like Heavenly Parent","date":"January 1, 2024","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-24/HakJaHan-240101.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"When it comes to this goal, we must achieve it with one heart and one will, no matter where we are.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Become true owners of Cheon Il Guk who practice true love like Heavenly Parent","date":"January 1, 2024","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-24/HakJaHan-240101.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"Let us become true devoted sons and daughters who can achieve higher results with every passing month and year based on which our Creator, the Heavenly Parent, can delight in and trust us.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Become true owners of Cheon Il Guk who practice true love like Heavenly Parent","date":"January 1, 2024","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-24/HakJaHan-240101.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"The world of peace of which humanity dreams cannot be achieved by human effort alone.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"On graduation, I will send Sun Moon University UPA cadets to the global mission","date":"January 4, 2024","place":"Cheon Jeong Gung","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-24/HakJaHan-240104.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"May the blessings and love of our Heavenly Parent and True Parents always be with you.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Heavenly Parent’s Holy Community","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-25/HakJaHan-250101.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"We are one family of humankind attending Heavenly Parent and practicing true love.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Revising 13th Year of Cheon Il Guk Motto to include: Fulfill Our Responsibility","date":"January 1, 2025","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-25/HakJaHan-250101b.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"In particular, I would like to express my deepest gratitude to God who has been my constant companion throughout my life.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Path for America and Humanity in the Last Days","date":"January 22, 2000","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon00/UM000122.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"I would like to conclude by expressing my hope for the beginning of a new millennial Kingdom overflowing with peace, freedom and justice in Heaven and on Earth.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Path for America and Humanity in the Last Days","date":"January 22, 2000","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon00/UM000122.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We are truly grateful for Your grace allowing us to welcome this world of freedom and unity.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"36th True God's Day - New Year Midnight Prayer","date":"January 1, 2003","place":"Chung Pyung Heaven and Earth Training Center, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon03/SM030101-mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The most serious problem of all is that people do not know that God is their Parent.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Morning Address","date":"January 1, 2003","place":"Chung Pyung Heaven and Earth Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon03/SM030101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The value of life that God, the world and the individual can all be happy about at the same time has to be found.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus' View of Life for the Sake of the Restoration","date":"January 6, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570106.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Only in living the life of sacrificing for others, in other words, only when you live the life of serving and loving others can you make eternal connections with God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus' View of Life for the Sake of the Restoration","date":"January 6, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570106.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"To practice love, you must, of your own accord, live a life of serving and caring for others.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus' View of Life for the Sake of the Restoration","date":"January 6, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570106.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Our life is not our own, the life we are leading is not our own, and the hope that we cherish is not our own.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus Who Looks Back On Walking the Path of His Fate","date":"February 10, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong, Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570210.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"If you listen to the words of God and can convey them on His behalf, the Lord will come toward you even if you do not ask Him.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Let Us Be the Ones Jesus Wants","date":"February 17, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong, Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570217.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Let us be able to worship Heaven by leading a heavenly life centered on love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Jesus Who Is To Establish Heaven's Love","date":"February 24, 1957","place":"Chung Pa Dong, Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon57/SunMyungMoon-570224.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"You must love your fellow humans with the same intensity that you love the Lord.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders Address","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650002.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"I want you to know that as much as you love me, please love the world even more.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders Address","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650002.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"We have no nationality, we have no boundary because there is no boundary in your heart.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders Address","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650002.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Under that circumstance, even, I felt that God was always there and was comforting me.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders Address","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650002.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Even though sometimes you feel that there is no God, know that He is always present.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders Address","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650002.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God is not asking you to seek the outward things but rather God is asking you to contemplate, to concentrate on the inward world of mind.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God is asking, hoping, and anxiously waiting so He can really pour out His love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"If your children really hit your heart deep in love, tears of gratitude flow.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"We must realize that God has been living all through eternity with His heart.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God is seeking the container that will be good enough to contain His love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Love of God is not found up above, or somewhere else, but here on earth.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God wants you to pick up even the smallest creation of His Kingdom and be proud of it as if it were a masterpiece of art.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"When you see some unfortunate thing happen in the road you must have such a loving heart that you cannot just pass by.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Even before misery and hurt hit you, God already tastes the hardship and He is one step ahead of you.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"When you are persecuted you must forget yourself and think from the position of God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"The more you really live the commandment, the more God is restoring what is needed.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"When you see the things of creation, love them as much as the Creator loves them.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Men Are Destined To Go The Road Of Restoration - Returning Home","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon65/SM650003.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Centering on God, we are the people transcending national boundaries, transcending private ownership, and transcending any group consciousness.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Address","date":"January 1, 1974","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon74/SunMyungMoon-740101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"If you pray hard for what you are going to do, and if you are going to put everything you have learned into practice, then God will be with you.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Address","date":"January 1, 1974","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon74/SunMyungMoon-740101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We are people of great ambition, and God will take delight in what we are doing.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Address","date":"January 1, 1974","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon74/SunMyungMoon-740101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We are going to be the ones who restore and bring hope to every corner of the world.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Instructions To IOWC Commanders And Team Members","date":"January 31, 1974","place":"Washington, DC","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon74/SunMyungMoon-740131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"You should know that eternal world peace will come from the family in which everyone is trying to give credit.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Liberation Of Heaven And Earth","date":"March 3, 1976","place":"Choongang Training Center (Sootaek-li) Kyungki-do, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SM760303.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Even if you realized the will of God, without knowing His heart, there is no value to it.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Liberation Of Heaven And Earth","date":"March 3, 1976","place":"Choongang Training Center (Sootaek-li) Kyungki-do, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SM760303.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Even though you find a history of tears on this earth, no person has shed more tears than God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Liberation Of Heaven And Earth","date":"March 3, 1976","place":"Choongang Training Center (Sootaek-li) Kyungki-do, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SM760303.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Peace can he found when there is effort to make one, effort to make a reconciliation.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"In One Battle We Want to Liquidate the Failures of the Past","date":"January 12, 1976","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760112.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Before we even dream of the unity of the universe, or between heaven and earth, we must initiate a movement of unity between mind and body.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"In One Battle We Want to Liquidate the Failures of the Past","date":"January 12, 1976","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760112.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"For unity, there should be one controlled direction so that everyone joins together for that one direction.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"In One Battle We Want to Liquidate the Failures of the Past","date":"January 12, 1976","place":"Belvedere","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760112.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"You should exemplify the meaning of unification, creating unity in the family, the society, and the country.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Message at the Unification Ceremony","date":"January 31, 1976","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Such a family can be the model for their neighbors and relatives, starting a unified circle.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Message at the Unification Ceremony","date":"January 31, 1976","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"In an atmosphere of love, all the elements in ourselves will harmonize and become tempered.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Message at the Unification Ceremony","date":"January 31, 1976","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/SunMyungMoon-760131.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Life has a direct bearing on us, and love is formed when you have a relationship with a reciprocating partner.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Central Figure And The Transitional Period","date":"March 7, 1976","place":"Chung-pa Dong Headquarters Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon76/sm760307.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"No matter what, nobody can outdo God, suffer more than God, or weep more tears than God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The way of restoration is to love other people more than your physical grandparents, because by doing so, you are expanding your family to the entire world.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"True love can be found in the lowest places, not in the Waldorf Astoria or in the palaces of kings.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"If I ask you to go to the dirtiest place under the sun, where it is smelly, you should be able to go with the power of true love and transform it into a fragrant place.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We should be able to love our clan more than our family and our nation more than our clan.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We can define the good God as the God who sacrifices Himself for the sake of others.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Once you obtain that true love, you can conquer and own everything else.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The ideal world is the world where mankind is one family, where there are no boundaries between races and skin colors.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/820101a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We do this through our connection of love, developed through the family unit.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820101-Mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When I bring the gift of true love, every door is automatically wide open.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820101-Mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The way of restoration is to expand your family out into the entire world, thus creating the heavenly kingdom anywhere.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Victory Of Home Church","date":"January 1, 1982","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon82/SunMyungMoon-820101-Mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"We know that an extraordinary time is coming when we should become children of filial piety and loyalty.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day Midnight Prayer","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101-mid.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"All the things of heaven and earth want to hear the words of love whispered in the language of God, and want to live within the sound of that language.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Creation and Building of the Kingdom Of Heaven","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"You have to receive recognition that you have loved God and mankind more than yourself.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Creation and Building of the Kingdom Of Heaven","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The more you mature, the more your senses draw you nearer to the awareness of love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Creation and Building of the Kingdom Of Heaven","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"All things that are complete, good, and valuable require and are based on love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Creation and Building of the Kingdom Of Heaven","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"Chung Pa Dong Church","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"From this time on, I am in the position of leading the world with absolute love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1986 Midnight Speech","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"Chung Pa Dong, Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101b.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"I am a person who only lives for the fulfillment of love centered on goodness.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1986 Midnight Speech","date":"January 1, 1986","place":"Chung Pa Dong, Church, Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860101b.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Just as everything was originally created according to the law of love, so everything is created anew according to the law of love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"In this respect we can say that the highest mountain is the mountain of love and the deepest valley is the valley of love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Individual perfection comes about when our mind and body perpetuate give-and-take action centered on the love of God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"True love is valuable not only because it is unchanging, but also because it cannot be exclusively owned by anybody.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"I understood the mystery and love of God by looking at how the young birds resembled their parents.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The true value of love is so absolute that no one, including myself, can measure it.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"After such a love foundation is formed, God will come to dwell with us.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When you open the door of love with your mind and body united, then your mind will resonate along with the entire universe.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The present you receive from the person whom you love is infinitely valuable and precious.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"All beings can be brought into existence and perfected only through the love relationship.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The door of love opens only in due course, and we should wait until it opens to enter in.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"All the principles of the universe operate perfectly, just like a perfect bowl of love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"God is the measure of value for all things because His characteristics do not change.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 1 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"God wanted human beings to have children so that they could experience joy in the giving and receiving of love.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"People who have tasted true love will never forget it and will never change their mind about it.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"If the great order of love is firmly established, then there will be no more war and this world will be filled with freedom and happiness.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Human beings want unchangeable love because there is an unchangeable nature deep within their original mind.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"The universe has its own laws of existence and interaction, and without love, no one can adapt to them.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"The Day of Victory of Love Part 2 of 4","date":"January 3, 1986","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon86/SunMyungMoon-860103a.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When we receive these things, we have to plant them in order to return something to God, to give thanks for what we have been given.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Sunday Service","date":"February 17, 1991","place":"Belvedere International Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/910217.htm","verified":true,"note":"date corrected from 1997 to 1991 per the page address and text"},
{"text":"We learned the purpose of human life, all these things and even we were given the chance to be called the sons and daughters of God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Sunday Service","date":"February 17, 1991","place":"Belvedere International Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/910217.htm","verified":true,"note":"date corrected from 1997 to 1991 per the page address and text"},
{"text":"We have good seed now, but we have to plant it into the ground, cultivate it and make a good harvest to return to God.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Sunday Service","date":"February 17, 1991","place":"Belvedere International Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/910217.htm","verified":true,"note":"date corrected from 1997 to 1991 per the page address and text"},
{"text":"Even though blessing is a heavy load, still you should receive it with gratitude and God will be with you.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Sunday Service","date":"February 17, 1991","place":"Belvedere International Training Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/910217.htm","verified":true,"note":"date corrected from 1997 to 1991 per the page address and text"},
{"text":"Even though someone may be our own parent, or our own husband, wife, or child, unless true love is in the relationship our minds will not feel close to each other.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1991 - Midnight","date":"January 1, 1991","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/SM910101.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"Since all the relationships of love in our family are the source of our life, when we think about our homeland we are thinking about the source of our life itself.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1991 - Midnight","date":"January 1, 1991","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/SM910101.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"We should treat not only our parents with love and respect but also our teachers.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1991 - Midnight","date":"January 1, 1991","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/SM910101.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"The relationship between parents and children is so strong that no one can go against it or change it in any way.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"God's Day 1991 - Midnight","date":"January 1, 1991","place":"Seoul, Korea","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/SM910101.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"In that capacity go to your hometown, gather the people, embrace them and love them and there is no one who will not respond to you.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Second Blessed Couples' Conference","date":"February 21, 1991","place":"World Mission Center, New York, NY USA","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon91/SM910220.HTM","verified":true},
{"text":"God can start from this family and go to the world and beyond and come back to your family again.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day Midnight Address","date":"January 1, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/960101md.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Once this time comes the world of peace, world of harmony, and world of happiness will become a reality.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day Midnight Address","date":"January 1, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/960101md.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Please remember the day when you truly dedicated yourself to God and truly worked for the sake of the entire humanity.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders' Conference","date":"January 2, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/960102.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"If you have an archenemy for example, but you say one word to melt his heart, in that instant you will become friends.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders' Conference","date":"January 2, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/960102.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Upon the completion of our family we should be proud of our tribe, our society, and so forth.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"Leaders' Conference","date":"January 2, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/960102.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"When we become united on the family level that is where we can find peace, freedom, unification and happiness.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/SM960101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Centered upon this harmony, peace, freedom, happiness and unification will all come about.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day","date":"not stated","place":"not stated","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/SM960101.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"Only when this takes place will you find peace, freedom, unification, love and happiness.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day","date":"January 1, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/SM960102.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"As you take each mouthful of food you have to thank God and invite Him to taste it with you.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day","date":"January 1, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/SM960102.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"God stands in the position of the original parent and He is the teacher of all teachers.","speaker":"Father Moon","source":"True God's Day","date":"January 1, 1996","place":"World Mission Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/SunMyungMoon96/SM960102.htm","verified":true},
{"text":"God freely gave all of creation to human beings, whom he created as his children and whom he hoped to live with in peace.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"As the true parent of humankind, God could never give up on his children.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"I felt truly at peace, with the cloudless sky, the rhythmic breezes of the cool wind, and the warm sunshine enveloping me from behind.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"With that sincerity and heart I rushed to nations in all corners of the world, no matter how unfortunate or remote they were.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"For this reason, I have invested everything to restore the original position of the Heavenly Parent to God.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Preface to the Mother of Peace, Hak Ja Han's Autobiography","date":"February 2020","place":"not stated (book preface)","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-20/HakJaHan-200200.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"As long as God is with us, we will certainly usher in a new year filled with hope and life.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"All Religions Have Reached The End, Yet We Need To Realize The World Of Peace","date":"January 9, 2022","place":"Cheongshim World Peace Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-22/HakJaHan-220109.pdf","verified":true},
{"text":"The blessings and grace of Heaven are overflowing in your families, your nations and the world.","speaker":"Mother Han","source":"Humankind can be saved only by the True Parents","date":"January 9, 2022","place":"Korea, Cheongshim Peace World Center","link":"https://www.tparents.org/Moon-Talks/HakJaHan-22/HakJaHan-220109b.pdf","verified":true}];
if(typeof module!="undefined")module.exports=QUOTES;
